    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 16 Domville Square, Cherrywood, Dublin 18, an exceptional three-bedroom, three-bathroom mid-terrace family home, ideally positioned within the highly sought-after and recently developed Domville Square development. Built in 2022 and presented in excellent condition throughout, this impressive property offers over 120 sq. m. of generous living accommodation, combined with an outstanding A2 energy rating, making it an ideal choice for modern family living.\nDomville Square forms part of the highly regarded Cherrywood community, a rapidly developing and exceptionally well-connected location which offers residents an excellent selection of amenities on their doorstep. The development itself benefits from a large communal children's playground, providing a fantastic safe and convenient outdoor space for younger residents and making this an especially attractive location for families. The area benefits from a host of local shops, cafés, restaurants, green spaces and recreational facilities, while Cherrywood Business Park and The Park at Carrickmines are also within easy reach. Excellent transport links are close by, with the Luas providing swift access towards Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas, while the M50 is easily accessible for commuters travelling throughout Dublin and beyond.\nInternally, the property boasts a superb layout with well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The ground floor comprises of a welcoming entrance hallway, generous living room and a contemporary open-plan kitchen/dining area, creating a fantastic space for both everyday living and entertaining. A separate utility room and downstairs wc completes the ground floor. Upstairs are three spacious bedrooms, with the impressive master bedroom benefiting from its own ensuite bathroom and walk-in wardrobe, the main family bathrooms completes the second level.\nA particular highlight is the home's impressive energy efficiency. Boasting an A2 BER rating and an air-to-water heat pump system, No. 16 offers excellent modern comfort while keeping energy efficiency firmly at the forefront. The property also comes with two designated parking spaces, a highly desirable feature, while the generous floor area of over 120 sq. m. provides an abundance of space rarely found in comparable homes.\nProperties of this calibre within such a modern and highly sought-after development are sure to attract strong interest from first-time buyers, young families and investors alike. No. 16 Domville Square combines contemporary design, excellent energy efficiency, generous accommodation and superb connectivity, all within one of Dublin 18's most desirable new residential locations. Early viewing is highly advised to appreciate all that this impressive home has to offer.\nFeatures\n•Over 120 sq. m. of living accommodation\n•A2 energy rating\n•3 Bedroom / 3 Bathroom terraced\n•Built in 2022\n•Management fees c. 375\n•Air-to-water heat pump\n•Master bedroom with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\n•2 designated parking spaces\n•Huge playground within a stones throw\n•Modern and highly sought-after development\n•Excellent condition throughout\n•Highly sought-after Cherrywood location\n•Excellent transport links including Luas and M50\n•Ideal first-time buyer/family home\nDirections\nEircode - D18 P23V\n"
      },
      {
